# SYSTEM TRACK for the ad encounter (issue 091a). Not in the record player: it is
# played on the encounter bus from the entrance's hit chord (frame 32) while the
# card is open. A PLACEHOLDER first draft, only so the build can be tested; Marc
# writes the real one (in the track editor or the music lab) and replaces this
# file. Key of G (the entrance's pulse run), 120 bpm, 16 beats = 8 seconds a pass,
# four passes then a fade. It starts on the downbeat the hit lands on.
title: Encounter Battle
note: System track for ad encounters. Placeholder. Not in the record player.
tempo: 120

